title: Barracuda CloudGen Firewall: Hardware Sensors
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/barracuda
license: GPLv2
distribution: phion
description:
 This check monitors the hardware sensors of a Barracuda CloudGen Firewall
 appliance, as reported by the Phion-MIB hwSensors table. Depending on the
 sensor type it reports:

 {Temperature} sensors, in degrees Celsius.

 {Fan} sensors, in RPM.

 {PSU} sensors, as their reported status. The {OK}/{WARN}/{CRIT} mapping
 is derived from values observed on live devices, since the vendor does
 not document them.

 {Voltage} sensors are reported for information only, without an
 associated check result.

 Levels for the temperature (upper) and fan speed (lower) can be
 configured via the ruleset "Phion/Barracuda Hardware Sensors".

item:
 The name of the hardware sensor as reported by the device.

discovery:
 One service is created for each hardware sensor reported by the device.
